{"id": "64636", "title": "倾城雪", "author": "落夕", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 9, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/64/64636.htm", "intro": "属性分类：现代／其他／未定／感动揪心\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n关键字：明星 　校园 　组织 \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n文案：\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n他是倾国倾城的男子，让无数的女人趋之若鹜，却唯独钟情于毫无女人味的她，\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n她，一个热爱武术的阳光女孩，心心念著他的大哥，可是从小到大，快乐时陪著她笑的人是他，悲伤时给予她温暖的也是他------\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n原来不知从什么时候起他已经成为她的影子，走进了她的心", "base": "files/article/html/64/64636", "chapters": [{"title": "1", "file": "9627635.html", "available": false}, {"title": "2", "file": "9627637.html", "available": false}, {"title": "3", "file": "9627638.html", "available": false}, {"title": "4", "file": "9627639.html", "available": false}, {"title": "5", "file": "9627640.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6", "file": "9627641.html", "available": false}, {"title": "7", "file": "9627643.html", "available": false}, {"title": "8", "file": "9627645.html", "available": false}, {"title": "完结", "file": "9627647.html", "available": false}]}